 advised to keep its scale the same on all axes and adjust its collision shape(s) instead.\n> \n> Also the configuration warning that pops up in the editor if you set the scale in a non-uniform way:\n> \n> > With a non-uniform scale this node will probably not function as expected.\n> > Please make its scale uniform (i.e. the same on all axes), and change the size in children collision shapes instead.\n\nIt was working in Godot's Physics Engine though 🤔 Should I then turn the value to 2?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433340127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433347399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111929#issuecomment-3433347399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111929","id":3433347399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MpLlH","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandS